@url=http://localhost:3000

###lista de vehiculos

GET {{url}}/vehiculos

### VEHICULO ID
GET {{url}}/vehiculos/1

### MODELO
GET {{url}}/vehiculos?modelo=Ranger

### PATENTE
GET {{url}}/vehiculos?patente=OPQ159

### AÑO MINIMO
GET {{url}}/vehiculos?añoMin=2010

### AÑO MAXIMO
GET {{url}}/vehiculos?añoMax=2000

### CAPACIDAD MINIMA
GET {{url}}/vehiculos?capacidadMin=700

### CAPACIDAD MAXIMA
GET {{url}}/vehiculos?capacidadMax=500

### COMBINAR FILTROS
GET {{url}}/vehiculos?modelo=Ranger&patente=OPQ159&añoMin=1990&añoMax=2017&capacidadMin=500&capacidadMax=1000



### crear vehiculo
POST {{url}}/vehiculos
Content-Type: application/json


{
    "marca":"Renault",
    "modelo":"Trueno",
    "año":2017,
    "capacidadCarga":600,

    "patente":"opq159"

    
}


### ACTUALIZAR VEHICULO POR ID
PUT {{url}}/vehiculos/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "marca": "Ford",
    "modelo": "Ranger",
    "patente": "ABC123",
    "año": 2018,
    "capacidadCarga": 1000
}

### ELIMINAR VEHICULO POR ID
DELETE {{url}}/vehiculos/1


